  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As someone with an \"abnormal\" left hand, I personally feel like the default grab threshold for index controllers is a little too strong and gets uncomfortable fast.\n\nWhile the \"Light Grip\" setting is a great step for accessibility, I'm personally unhappy with it because it then becomes too easy to grab things accidentally.\n\nI strongly believe the \"Light Grip\" toggle should become a \"Grip Strength\" slider that is (VERY importantly) able to be a different value for each hand.",
